# Topic fw8-core: the base of the Android 8.1 framework.
# HIDL: libhidl, libhwbinder (in-process stubs), hidl-gen (host tool, Java of
# the HIDL interfaces framework.jar links statically) and the interfaces;
# protobuf: aprotoc (host, javanano and javastream for core/proto);
# the boot class path libraries (conscrypt, okhttp, bouncycastle, ext,
# apache-xml, org.apache.http.legacy.boot, telephony-common, voip-common,
# ims-common); boringssl: its headers for conscrypt's NativeConstants.java.
# frameworks/av, system/netd, system/update_engine: .aidl files of framework.jar.
